# Derived — regenerated by ZuloOne on every export
.generated/
ZuloOne.Workspace.csproj
.zuloone-export-manifest.json
bin/
obj/
*.conflict

# Integration-test artifacts. The dev stand syncs this folder, so anything a test
# creates is exported here — models named "<Prefix><8 hex>" (ApiFixture.Suffix)
# and their contents. They are transient by definition and must never be committed.
# Sweep the stand with POST /api/dev/test-artifacts/sweep to remove them for real.
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]/
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].cs
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].script.json
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].object.json
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]Id.json
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]EventHandler.cs
*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]EventHandler.script.json

# …but a name ending in DIGITS is not a MetaId, it is a timestamp, and its last
# eight digits are valid hex by accident. That accident cost a red build: the
# rules above swallowed a job's script, so the job was committed and the script
# it points at was not, and every import since failed the foreign key.
!*_[0-9]*.cs
!*_[0-9]*.script.json

# Byte-code from running the CI scripts by hand.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
